OL,3,GNorth East
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FA dry and
OL,6,Fbright evening to come with plenty of
OL,7,Flate sunshine. Cloud thickening
OL,8,Fovernight with the chance of some
OL,9,Fshowery rain, mainly across
OL,10,FNorthumberland and the Pennines.
OL,11,FWarmer than recent nights.
OL,12,
OL,13,CSunday:FRather cloudy start to Sunday
OL,14,Fwith outbreaks of rain possible. These
OL,15,Fmost likely at first, and again into
OL,16,Fthe evening. Cooler than Saturday, but
OL,17,Fstill warm in any brightness.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
