OL,3,GNorth East
OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Monday to Wednesday:
OL,6,FSettled and generally dry, with some
OL,7,Fcloud and plenty of lengthy sunshine.
OL,8,FTurning very warm but also rather
OL,9,Fbreezy at times in coastal areas and
OL,10,Fover higher ground.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
